<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
Dispute #{{disputeId}} of swap <a
  href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">#{{orderId}}</a> has
passed the vote appeal phase. It is now time for the <b>dispute execution
  phase</b>. During dispute execution:
<ul>
  <li>If the ruling is "Release", the asset is released to the taker.</li>
  <li>If the ruling is "Cancel", the swap will be cancelled and asset
    returned to the liquidity provider.
  </li>
  <li>If the ruling is "Stalled", the dispute's appeal period is extended,
    allowing the swap participants to appeal.
  </li>
</ul>
<br>
Ruling: <b style="font-size:22px; color: orange;">{{outcome}}</b>
<br>
{{#if drafted}}
  <h3 style="color: lightseagreen">TIP</h3>
  <ul style="color: lightseagreen">
    <li>You can earn protocol rewards for executing this dispute before
      others do it. Visit the swap <a href="https://app.fiatx
      .co/swap/{{orderId}}">page</a> to execute the dispute.
    </li>
  </ul>
{{/if}}
<br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">How Disputes Work</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
